    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/ccb23d5f131d6bbd22d01a3ba60262ea.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>Battle and explore as Bumblebee in an adventure to stop his nemesis, Mandroid, from becoming the ultimate evil cyborg!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/1a9ed1d05bdfeb3e2bc7ad662fae674e.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>Bumblebee is facing his greatest mission \u2013 reclaim the ancient Cybertronian technology scattered across the globe before Mandroid and his henchbots can use them to destroy Earth\u2019s cities. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/abebce6c1ffb39de86562dde454ea056.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>With Optimus Prime\u2019s guidance and you at the controls, Bumblebee will grow strong enough to take on an army of robotic enemies in bare-metal combat, find the lost technology, and unlock powerful new attack combos and abilities along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There\u2019s a wide world of Transformers action to discover. Gear up for boss battles with some of the series\u2019 greatest villains, hunt down secrets, and build your relics collection as you explore three expansive locations. With gameplay modes designed for new and experienced players, there\u2019s a challenge for every Transformers generation.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/ccb23d5f131d6bbd22d01a3ba60262ea.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>Battle and explore as Bumblebee in an adventure to stop his nemesis, Mandroid, from becoming the ultimate evil cyborg!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/d2f834dc3bd8e97f0790f8a0be2f1656.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/1a9ed1d05bdfeb3e2bc7ad662fae674e.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>Bumblebee is facing his greatest mission \u2013 reclaim the ancient Cybertronian technology scattered across the globe before Mandroid and his henchbots can use them to destroy Earth\u2019s cities. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/9da9017d3049421e7f78f0a0431cbafb.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/abebce6c1ffb39de86562dde454ea056.avif?t=1727088547\" /></div><br><br>With Optimus Prime\u2019s guidance and you at the controls, Bumblebee will grow strong enough to take on an army of robotic enemies in bare-metal combat, find the lost technology, and unlock powerful new attack combos and abilities along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.poster.avif?t=1727088547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.webm?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955800/extras/eedf241b1dea83e4436261b960eba62e.mp4?t=1727088547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>There\u2019s a wide world of Transformers action to discover. Gear up for boss battles with some of the series\u2019 greatest villains, hunt down secrets, and build your relics collection as you explore three expansive locations. With gameplay modes designed for new and experienced players, there\u2019s a challenge for every Transformers generation.",
